## 1. Introduction

### 1.1 Purpose

Complete specification for Myah Travels website—a personal brand, blog, and client onboarding platform.

### 1.2 Scope

- Blog and content management
- Destination guides
- Product/service reviews
- YouTube video integration (manual)
- Client inquiry form and database
- Client/group portal (magic link access)
- Admin dashboard
- Self-hosted on mini PC

### 1.3 Definitions

| Term | Definition |
|------|------------|
| Admin | Single user (Myah) with full system access |
| Portal Member | Person with magic link access to specific portal |
| Magic Link | Time-limited URL sent via email for portal access |
| Global Announcement | Message sent to all portal members (formerly "All-Hands") |
| Soft Delete | Record marked deleted but retained |
| Anonymize | Strip PII, keep statistical value |
| 2FA | Two-Factor Authentication (TOTP) |
| Activity Log | Audit trail of all actions |

