## 2. System Overview

### 2.1 User Roles

| Role | Access | Authentication |
|------|--------|----------------|
| Admin | Full system access | Username + Password + TOTP (2FA) |
| Portal Member | Specific portal only | Magic link → Session cookie |
| Visitor | Public content | None |

### 2.2 Key Design Decisions

| Decision | Choice | Rationale |
|----------|--------|-----------|
| Portal Auth | Magic links (2-step) | No passwords, individual revocation, email-scanner safe |
| Admin Auth | Lucia Auth + TOTP | Session security + 2FA for PII protection |
| Backup | Local storage on mini PC | Physical ownership, no cloud costs |
| Privacy Policy | Dedicated public page | Legal compliance, always accessible |
| Search | FTS5 with triggers | Always current, better ranking |
| Soft Delete | 90-day retention | Prevent data loss, control storage growth |
| Data Retention | Policy-based purge | PIPEDA compliance, storage management |

