## 3. Architecture Design

### 3.1 Technology Stack (Final)

| Component | Technology |
|-----------|------------|
| Framework | Next.js (App Router, TypeScript) |
| Database | SQLite (WAL mode, busy_timeout=5000) |
| ORM | Drizzle |
| Auth (Admin) | Lucia Auth + TOTP (2FA) |
| Auth (Portal) | Magic links + session cookies |
| Editor | TipTap |
| Email | Resend (with email queue) |
| Analytics | Cloudflare Web Analytics |
| Image Processing | Sharp |
| Search | SQLite FTS5 with triggers |
| Spam Protection | Cloudflare Turnstile |
| Deployment | GitHub + SSH script |
| OS | Ubuntu Server LTS (LUKS full-disk encryption) |
| Tunnel | Cloudflare Tunnel |

### 3.2 System Architecture

```
[Visitor/Client/Admin Browser]
     ↓ HTTPS
[Cloudflare Edge] ← DNS, CDN, Analytics, Turnstile
     ↓ Encrypted Tunnel
[Mini PC - Ubuntu Server (LUKS encrypted)]
     ↓
[Next.js Application]
     ├── Public Pages (ISR/SSG)
     ├── Admin Routes (protected)
     ├── Portal Routes (magic link)
     └── API Routes
     ↓
[SQLite Database (WAL mode)]
     ├── Application tables
     ├── FTS5 search index (with triggers)
     ├── Sessions (Lucia + Portal)
     └── Email queue
     ↓
[File System]
     ├── Media uploads
     ├── Backups (local, same disk)
     └── Logs
```

