## 7. Client Portal Specifications

### 7.1 Magic Link Flow (Updated - 2-Step)

**Email received:**
```
Subject: Your [Portal Name] Access Link

Click below to access your trip portal:
[Link: /portal/access/[token]]

This link expires in 7 days.
```

**Step 1 - GET /portal/access/[token]:**
- Token validated (not consumed)
- Landing page displayed:
  ```
  "Welcome to [Portal Name]"
  [Continue to Portal] button
  ```

**Step 2 - POST /portal/consume/[token]:**
- Token validated again
- Token marked as used
- Portal session created (30 days)
- Redirect to portal dashboard

**Session Expiry:**
- Portal shows "Session expired"
- "Request new access link" button
- Button emails admin (or auto-sends new link)

### 7.2 Global Announcement Display

- Global announcements shown at top of every portal
- Marked with "Global Announcement" badge
- Cannot be dismissed (but members can opt out of email notifications)

