## 13. Data Retention Policy

### 13.1 Retention Schedule

| Data Type | Retention Period | After Period |
|-----------|------------------|--------------|
| Active clients (contacted/booked) | Indefinite (while active) | Anonymize after 7 years |
| Inactive leads (no contact) | 2 years | Anonymize |
| Booked clients (completed travel) | 7 years | Anonymize |
| Activity logs | 12 months in DB | Archive to file |
| Archived logs | 24 months total | Delete |
| Soft-deleted records | 90 days | Hard purge |
| Portal magic links | 7 days | Delete |
| Portal sessions | 30 days | Delete |
| Email queue sent | 30 days | Delete |
| Email queue failed | 90 days | Delete |
| Revisions | Indefinite | Keep (small storage) |
| Media files | Until deleted | Soft delete → 90 days → purge |

### 13.2 Automated Jobs

```bash
# Daily cron (3:00 AM)
0 3 * * * /var/www/site/scripts/cleanup-daily.sh

# Weekly cron (Sunday 4:00 AM)
0 4 * * 0 /var/www/site/scripts/cleanup-weekly.sh

# cleanup-daily.sh
# - Delete expired magic links (>7 days)
# - Delete expired portal sessions (>30 days)
# - Delete sent emails (>30 days)
# - Purge soft-deleted records (>90 days)

# cleanup-weekly.sh
# - Archive activity logs (>12 months)
# - Delete archived logs (>24 months)
# - Anonymize inactive leads (>2 years no contact)
```

